  return `=== MCP Config (v${_M0FP411vicTop_2dcw10fist_2dmbt3cmd3cli9help__mcpN1vS41016}) ===\n\nStart: fist serve  (stdio transport)\n\n.mcp.json template (paste into your client):\n  mcpServers.fist-mbt.command = fist\n  mcpServers.fist-mbt.args    = [\"serve\"]\n  mcpServers.fist-mbt.timeout_ms = 30000\n\nFull JSON file: see _release/.mcp.json.example\n\nPrereq: Node.js >=24, fist in PATH\nClients: Claude Desktop, VSCode MCP, Trae\n\nProtocol: MCP 2026-07-28 required (colmugx/mcp@0.17.4 hard pin).\nIf your client fails handshake with -32022 Unsupported protocol version,\nit speaks an older protocol (e.g. 2024-11-05); upgrade the client or use\none supporting 2026-07-28. Upstream mcp lib 0.15+ moved to this version.`;
